 iquitin-autophagy signaling)\, and Nektarios Tavernarakis (University of C
 rete – autophagy and aging\, C. elegans). Direct mechanistic overlap wit
 h the Atlas's mTORC1-lysosome-autophagy axis.\n\nSpeakers or organisers wi
 th a profile in the Atlas: Ana Maria Cuervo\, Nektarios Tavernarakis\n\nCo
 nference site: https://autofagia.org/\n\nIn Oliver's mTOR Atlas: https://m
